Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:17:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): a crash record quotes only the failed run's
 output and names the worker's failure cause [daveey]

The per-task worker log is append-only; a run that died at start was reported with the previous
run's final message. Cut the log at the previous exit trailer. A managed worker that dies (at start
or later, e.g. WorkerPersistenceError in flush_token_counts) books one redacted cause line on its
attempt, and the client's 'Kanban execution unknown' refusal quotes it. (t_01a18b38b3fe3a5b)
